  "kind": "special",
  "from": "2024",
  "description": "Fuselage: Texas flag wrapped on the fuselage: forward third (nose back to just ahead of the wing) solid royal blue with one large white five-pointed star on the side over the windows; behind that the upper half white and lower half red, the red/white split running roughly along the window line to the tail. Cheatlines: None. Tail: Standard Southwest 'Heart' fin: bold blue lower, then a red band, then a yellow-gold band along the top/leading edge, with thin white/silver pinstripes between; white 'Southwest' title on the blue at the base of the fin; small US flag. Engines: Blue cowlings with red lip/rear accents (approximate). Winglets: White/gray (approximate). Titles: 'Southwest' in white on the lower fin; small 'Lone Star One' script by the cockpit. Artwork: Texas flag. Colors hex: approximate; Southwest brand Bold Blue is commonly given as #304CB2 (unverified for this paint).",
  "confidence": "medium",
